    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE NEXT GAME IN THE NIGHTMARE FILES SERIES!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/6e6d04ad8c0d679aab57e2325b4d6714.avif?t=1735776428\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/91c0ac1126d7ace47b575dd71a6d04c8.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=180 /></span><strong>You see a newspaper ad about a house-sitting job. Since you're short on money, you decide to sign up.</strong> <i>What awaits you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/205bf765833ef0d8a206ffcc8771df0a.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Did I mention that the house you'll be staying at has the latest home automation systems of the 80s!? Now you know! Simply clap twice in any room in the house to toggle the lights on/off. We sure are lucky that there are no entities around that can take advantage of this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/56dd2eca0cf4b4091730e47b6a346294.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span>Immerse yourself in the environment with amnesia-like physical interactions, volumetric audio and PS1 style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/2f3bbe8bc704e50e82ca47cbfd8e2983.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span>It ain't much, but it's honest work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/f531396851b9c17d5454b0aed4c98038.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/f531396851b9c17d5454b0aed4c98038.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/f531396851b9c17d5454b0aed4c98038.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5587220040aab809d6070f406dade379.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span>I suggest you don't go snooping around too much, it's for your own good. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/88070dd89a557d94c321c4d8701f1578.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/88070dd89a557d94c321c4d8701f1578.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/88070dd89a557d94c321c4d8701f1578.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/bf335dfdc5113af9cbf1d5ff4bd1b1f0.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/91c0ac1126d7ace47b575dd71a6d04c8.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=180 /></span><strong>You see a newspaper ad about a house-sitting job. Since you're short on money, you decide to sign up.</strong> <i>What awaits you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/205bf765833ef0d8a206ffcc8771df0a.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/5c69afbc8ae4d94031b97b8b84b04d45.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Did I mention that the house you'll be staying at has the latest home automation systems of the 80s!? Now you know! Simply clap twice in any room in the house to toggle the lights on/off. We sure are lucky that there are no entities around that can take advantage of this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/ad8eec175f33537c97a35682f362b30b.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/56dd2eca0cf4b4091730e47b6a346294.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span>Immerse yourself in the environment with amnesia-like physical interactions, volumetric audio and PS1 style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.webm?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/9980f0d2ce85773f6308d5a7c7e98288.mp4?t=1735776428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/2f3bbe8bc704e50e82ca47cbfd8e2983.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=90 /></span>It ain't much, but it's honest work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/f531396851b9c17d5454b0aed4c98038.poster.avif?t=1735776428\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933290/extras/f531396851b9c17